### Listar logs (todos)
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar logs por tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs?tenant_id={{tenant_id}}&page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar logs por ação
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs?acao=login&page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar logs por período
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs?from=2026-04-01&to=2026-04-05&page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar log por ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs/{{log_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exportar logs CSV
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/logs/export?tenant_id={{tenant_id}}&from=2026-04-01&to=2026-04-05
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/csv
